Question:
设有两个二维总体 $G_{1}$ 和 $G_{2}$ ，总体均值和协方差阵分别为

$$
\begin{aligned}
& \mu_{1}=\left[\begin{array}{l}
10 \\
15
\end{array}\right], \quad \Sigma_{1}=\left[\begin{array}{ll}
18 & 12 \\
12 & 32
\end{array}\right], \\
& \mu_{2}=\left[\begin{array}{l}
20 \\
25
\end{array}\right], \quad \Sigma_{2}=\left[\begin{array}{cc}
20 & -7 \\
-7 & 5
\end{array}\right]
\end{aligned}
$$

现有一样品 $X_{0}=(15,20)^{\prime}$, 试用距离判别法判定 $X_{0}$ 属于哪个总体?                           A. G1                                                                                                 B. G2
